# UI — Tailwind + shadcn

## Styling

Use Tailwind utilities. Keep components clear; avoid premature abstraction layers.

Utility helper: `src/lib/utils.ts` (`cn()` for class merging).

## shadcn components

Install with the latest shadcn CLI:

```bash
pnpm dlx shadcn@latest add button
```

Replace `button` with the component name. Follow existing shadcn config in the repo.

## MVP UI focus

Catalog browsing, resource detail, auth flows, save-to-library CTA. Match the existing layout in `src/routes/__root.tsx`.

Do not add dashboard, timeline, or admin UI unless the current milestone explicitly requires it.
